From 16875a955917f3fa2077f85ecadfe5c8fa8233aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tao Xiaobai <1599170798@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:23:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Little Craft Launcher: package with a Qt host and enter
 through LclGameEntryActivity

- The application id, name and provider authorities are the host's; arm64-v8a
  only; minSdk 29.
- Optional :lcl_host library module packages a prepared Qt application
  directory (-PlclHostDir) whose QtActivity becomes the launcher entry.
- The runtime works inside the host's app-private data root: game files in
  cache/minecraft, instances in game/<id>.
- LclGameEntryActivity turns a host launch request into the runtime's profile
  and account records, ensures a Java runtime and starts MainActivity.
